    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Dynamic Secrets"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Dynamic secrets are generated on-demand with short TTLs. For example, Vault can create a temporary database credential that expires after an hour."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Secret Rotation"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Rotate secrets regularly to limit exposure. Automated rotation reduces the risk of compromised secrets going undetected."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
